  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - No additional external openings including any doors or windows or other glazed areas shall be formed in any elevation of the application building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Location - Borough of Hounslow Doc, Existing Plan - Ground Floor- With external area, Existing Plan- Ground Floor, Existing Plan - First floor, Existing Plan - Existing Front Elevation E-01, Existing Plan - Existing garden elevation E-02, Existing Plan - Existing side/rear elevation E-03, Proposed Plan- Ground Floor - With external area, Proposed Plan - Ground Floor, Proposed Plan - First Floor, Proposed Plan - Existing Front Elevation E-01, Proposed Plan - Existing garden elevation E-02, Proposed Plan - Existing side/rear elevation E-03 Received 17/02/2011\r\nDesign & Access Statement Received 03/03/2011)  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification), no windows/dormer windows [other than those expressly authorised by this permission] shall be constructed.",
    "Condition : 5 - The car parking provision shown on Drawing No. Proposed Plan - Ground Floor - With external area for the proposed new residential unit shall be provided before the residential unit to which it relates is first occupied, and thereafter it shall not be used for any purpose other than the parking of vehicles.",
    "Condition : 6 - The area of garden/amenity space as shown on Drawing No. Proposed Plan - Ground Floor - With external area shall be provided as indicated prior to the first occupation of the development, and shall thereafter be retained.",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the house hereby approved is first occupied, the developer shall provide to the dwelling a green box container and any other type of containers required at the time of development for household use for the storage and collection of recyclable materials for the purposes of the Council's kerbside recycling service, to the specification then in use by the local authority's recycling collection service (or to such other specification as shall first be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority) and shall notify the Council's refuse and recycling services when the development is first occupied. The house shall also be supplied with a garden waste composting bin of at least 220 litres capacity at the same time."
  ],
